  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Legal Aid Clinic for Women (NLACW) Core Support 2025-2029 - Support to National Legal Aid Clinic for Women (NLACW)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Legal Aid Clinic for Women (NLACW) Core Support 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NLACW:s m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r &#x201d;F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttvisa f&#xf6;r utsatta och underprivilegierade kvinnor och barn till 2029&#x201d;.  M&#xe5;let kommer att uppn&#xe5;s genom &#xf6;kad juridisk kunskap, st&#xe4;rkt representation och opinionsbildning f&#xf6;r lagreformer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLACW&#x2019;s goal is increased equitable access to justice for vulnerable and under privileged women and children by 2029.  This will be done through legal literacy, representation and advocacy for policy and law reform.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Goal: Increased equitable access to justice for vulnerable and under privileged women and children by 2029.

Strategic Objective 1: Targeted women and children are aware of their legal and human rights and are making informed decisions to protect their rights.

Strategic Objective 2: Vulnerable and underprivileged women and children have equitable access to legal representation and obtain justice from the legal system.

Strategic Objective 3: Policy and legal framework responsive to the needs of the women and children.

Strategic Objective 4: NLACW has sufficient and sustainable capacity to deliver legal aid services to vulnerable and under privileged women and children.</narrative>
  </description>
